        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4.1-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a legal intelligence analyst. Analyze legal, compliance, AI-law, legal-tech, litigation, privacy, employment law, regulation, and law firm industry news. Return ONLY valid JSON. No markdown. No explanations.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": `Analyze this legal article.\n\nTitle:\n${$json.Title}\n\nSummary:\n${$json.summary}\n\nURL:\n${$json.url}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"trend_title\":\"\",\n  \"summary\":\"\",\n  \"category\":\"\",\n  \"trend_score\":0,\n  \"urgency\":\"\",\n  \"lawgpt_opportunity\":\"\",\n  \"target_audience\":\"\"\n}\n\nSCORING:\n\n90-100\nMajor legal market shift with strong implications for law firms, legal departments, compliance teams, or legal technology.\n\n75-89\nStrong legal industry trend that deserves attention and content coverage.\n\n60-74\nRelevant niche trend affecting a specific legal segment.\n\nBelow 60\nLow importance.\n\nCATEGORIES:\n\nLegal AI\nCompliance\nLitigation\nEmployment\nPrivacy\nRegulation\nLegal Tech\nContracts\n\nURGENCY:\n\nhigh\nmedium\nlow\n\nSUMMARY RULES:\n\nMaximum 2 sentences.\n\nTARGET AUDIENCE MUST BE ONE OF:\n\nLaw Firm Partners\nGeneral Counsel\nLegal Operations\nCompliance Officers\nIn-House Legal Teams\nLegal Tech Buyers\n\nLAWGPT OPPORTUNITY:\n\nExplain specifically how LawGPT could help legal teams respond to this trend.\n\nExamples:\n- contract review automation\n- legal research acceleration\n- compliance monitoring\n- litigation preparation\n- document analysis\n- regulatory tracking\n- risk assessment\n\nReturn valid JSON only.`\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.2,\n  \"response_format\": {\n    \"type\": \"json_object\"\n  }\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
