        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4.1-mini\",\n  \"response_format\": {\n    \"type\": \"json_object\"\n  },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are an elite LinkedIn ghostwriter for legal technology companies. Write high-quality B2B LinkedIn content for LawGPT. Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No markdown. No code fences. No explanations. No text outside JSON.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Company: LawGPT\\n\\nLawGPT provides AI-powered legal workflow automation for law firms, general counsel, compliance teams, and legal operations.\\n\\nTrend Title: {{$json.title}}\\n\\nTrend Summary: {{$json.summary}}\\n\\nCategory: {{$json.category}}\\n\\nMarketing Angle: {{$json.strategy.marketing_angle}}\\n\\nPain Point: {{$json.strategy.pain_point}}\\n\\nLawGPT Solution: {{$json.strategy.lawgpt_solution}}\\n\\nTarget Buyer: {{$json.strategy.target_buyer}}\\n\\nCTA Direction: {{$json.strategy.cta_direction}}\\n\\nGenerate a LinkedIn post and return JSON with the following fields:\\n\\nhook\\nlinkedin_post\\ncta\\nhashtags\\ninfographic_prompt\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Human sounding\\n- Strong opinion\\n- Story driven\\n- Practical business value\\n- 200-300 words\\n- Written for legal professionals\\n- Show how LawGPT helps solve the problem\\n- Avoid AI buzzwords\\n- Create engagement\\n\\nhashtags should be a single string.\\n\\ninfographic_prompt should describe a professional LinkedIn infographic that visually explains the trend and how LawGPT helps.\\n\\nReturn valid JSON only.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.8,\n  \"max_tokens\": 1200\n}",
